# Yorion's enters trigger exiles "any number of other nonland permanents you own and control" and returns "those cards" at the
# beginning of the next end step. Only the permanents Bot1 both owns and controls may be chosen (CR 108.3, 110.2): not Bot1's
# Ornithopter (given to Bot2 by Harmless Offering), not Bot2's Mox Ruby (given to Bot1), not a land, not Yorion itself, not
# Bot2's other permanents. Bot1 chooses a tapped Mox Pearl, a tapped Mox Sapphire and a Spirit token but leaves the Staff
# of the Storyteller (any number, not all). The moxen return as new objects, untapped (CR 400.7); the token ceased to exist
# in exile (CR 111.7) and does not return. They return only at the end step: before it all are still in exile.

